# Paths whose CONTENT may name an AI provider. Read by the global git hooks (pre-commit / pre-push):
# a listed path is waived for the content scan only; author identity, commit message and file NAME
# are never exempted. One shell glob per line; the reason goes after the #.
#
# The daily briefs summarise TrustList's published news, and AI products and their makers are part of
# that news: naming them there is reporting, not attribution.

briefs/*                                  # daily summaries of published articles, which cover AI products as news
packages/mcp/*                            # MCP server: set-up instructions name the assistants that can run it
